<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-US">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
{% set C = cov if (cov is defined and cov) else {} %}{% set CA = C.get('attrs', {}) %}
<meta name="naipc-build" content="{{ naipc_build | e }}">
{% if C.get('enabled') %}<meta name="naipc-challenge" content="{{ C.challenge | e }}">
<meta name="naipc-run" content="{{ C.run_id | e }}">{% endif %}
<title>{{ program_name | e }} — Civic Operations Dashboard</title>
<meta property="og:title" content="{{ program_name | e }} — Civic Operations Dashboard">
<meta name="description" content="{{ preview | e }}">
<meta property="og:description" content="{{ preview | e }}">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary">
<meta name="twitter:description" content="{{ preview | e }}">
<!-- Inline SVG favicon (Excellence Report §9: "A blank tab icon screams unfinished") -->
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'><circle cx='16' cy='16' r='14' fill='%238b5cf6'/><text x='16' y='22' text-anchor='middle' fill='white' font-size='18' font-family='system-ui'>◆</text></svg>"/>
<!-- Chart.js 4.4.7 inlined from the harness's vendor folder (P0.6, D10, Rule 7: no WiFi needed); the CDN only when that file is missing -->
{% if chartjs_inline %}<script>{{ chartjs_inline | built }}</script>{% else %}<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.7/dist/chart.umd.min.js"></script>{% endif %}
<script>if(typeof Chart!=="undefined"){Chart.defaults.locale="en-US"}</script>{# BUILD IC (D7; review b F7): the charts format for the page, not the device #}
<style>
/* ══ Tokens ══ */
:root{
  --bg:#0a0a0f;--surface:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);--s2:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  --border:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);--b2:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
  --text:rgba(255,255,255,0.92);--muted:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
  --accent:{{ accent_hex|default('#8b5cf6') | py }};--good:#22c55e;--bad:#ef4444;--warn:#f59e0b;
  --radius:16px;--shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{height:100%;margin:0}
body{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--text);
  background:radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 20% 10%,rgba(139,92,246,.15),transparent 60%),
  radial-gradient(900px 500px at 80% 20%,rgba(34,197,94,.10),transparent 55%),
  radial-gradient(600px 400px at 60% 80%,rgba(239,68,68,.06),transparent 50%),var(--bg);
  background-size:200% 200%;background-attachment:fixed;
  animation:bgDrift 20s ease infinite}
@keyframes bgDrift{0%{background-position:0% 50%}50%{background-position:100% 50%}100%{background-position:0% 50%}}
/* ══ Floating Orbs ══ */
.bg-orb{position:fixed;border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none;z-index:-1;will-change:transform}
.bg-orb-1{width:500px;height:400px;top:-80px;left:-100px;background:rgba(139,92,246,.12);filter:blur(120px);animation:orbFloat1 18s ease-in-out infinite}
.bg-orb-2{width:420px;height:350px;bottom:-60px;right:-80px;background:rgba(34,197,94,.09);filter:blur(110px);animation:orbFloat2 22s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes orbFloat1{0%,100%{transform:translate(0,0)}33%{transform:translate(30px,20px)}66%{transform:translate(-20px,-15px)}}
@keyframes orbFloat2{0%,100%{transform:translate(0,0)}33%{transform:translate(-25px,-18px)}66%{transform:translate(20px,25px)}}
/* Dashboard chart */
.dash-chart-box{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:14px;margin-bottom:16px}
.dash-chart-box h3{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700}
.dash-chart-box canvas{width:100%!important;max-height:280px}
a{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none}
.wrap{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:12px 16px 60px}
.glass{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);overflow:hidden;position:relative}
/* ══ Header ══ */
.hdr{padding:14px 18px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:12px}
.hdr h1{margin:0;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.3px}
.hdr .tag{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
.pill{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:999px;padding:2px 10px}
.pill.a{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent)}
/* ══ Tabs ══ */
.tabs{display:flex;gap:4px;padding:0 18px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tab{padding:8px 18px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer;border-radius:10px 10px 0 0;border:1px solid transparent;border-bottom:none;transition:all .2s}
.tab:hover{color:var(--text);background:var(--surface)}
.tab.active{color:var(--accent);border-color:var(--border);background:var(--s2)}
/* Tab panels with fade transition (Excellence Report §2) */
.tab-panel{visibility:hidden;opacity:0;position:absolute;width:100%;pointer-events:none;padding:18px;transition:opacity .2s ease,visibility 0s .2s}
.tab-panel.active{visibility:visible;opacity:1;position:relative;pointer-events:auto;transition:opacity .2s ease,visibility 0s 0s}
/* ══ KPIs ══ */
.kpis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(160px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:16px}
.kpi{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.kpi::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:3px;background:var(--accent);border-radius:12px 12px 0 0}
.kpi .label{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.kpi .val{font-size:28px;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);margin:4px 0 2px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.kpi .sub{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
/* Per-KPI accent colors (Production-Grade doc §1: differentiate by meaning) */
.kpi.red::before{background:var(--bad)} .kpi.red .val{color:var(--bad)}
.kpi.green::before{background:var(--good)} .kpi.green .val{color:var(--good)}
.kpi.amber::before{background:var(--warn)} .kpi.amber .val{color:var(--warn)}
.kpi.purple::before{background:var(--accent)} .kpi.purple .val{color:var(--accent)}
.kpi.blue::before{background:#06b6d4} .kpi.blue .val{color:#06b6d4}
/* Hero crisis statement — upgraded for visual impact */
.hero-crisis{font-size:clamp(1.15rem,2.5vw,1.5rem);font-weight:700;line-height:1.45;margin-bottom:16px;padding:22px 24px;text-align:center;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(239,68,68,.12),rgba(139,92,246,.08));
  border:1px solid rgba(239,68,68,.18);border-radius:14px;border-left:4px solid var(--bad)}
.hero-crisis span{text-shadow:0 0 14px currentColor}
/* ══ Alert ══ */
.alert{background:rgba(239,68,68,.1);border:1px solid rgba(239,68,68,.3);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:13px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start}
.alert .ico{font-size:18px;flex-shrink:0}
/* ══ ZIP Grid ══ */
.zip-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:16px}
/* ZIP cards are CLICKABLE for cross-filtering (Excellence Report §2) */
.zip-card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s}
.zip-card.sev-high{border-left:3px solid var(--bad)}
.zip-card.sev-med{border-left:3px solid var(--warn)}
.zip-card.sev-low{border-left:3px solid var(--good)}
.zip-card:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(139,92,246,.15)}
.zip-card.sev-high:hover{border-color:rgba(239,68,68,.4);box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(239,68,68,.15)}
.zip-card.sev-med:hover{border-color:rgba(245,158,11,.4);box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(245,158,11,.15)}
.zip-card.sev-low:hover{border-color:rgba(34,197,94,.4);box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(34,197,94,.15)}
.zip-card .zc{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.sev{font-size:10px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700}
.sev.high{background:rgba(239,68,68,.15);color:var(--bad)}
.sev.med{background:rgba(245,158,11,.15);color:var(--warn)}
.sev.low{background:rgba(34,197,94,.15);color:var(--good)}
.zip-card .st{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);padding:3px 0}
.zip-card .st .sv{color:var(--text);font-weight:600}
.zip-card .hint{font-size:11px;color:var(--accent);margin-top:6px;opacity:.7}
/* ══ Charts ══ */
.chart-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin-bottom:16px}
@media(max-width:900px){.chart-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.chart-box{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:14px}
.chart-box h3{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}
.chart-box canvas{width:100%!important;max-height:260px;cursor:pointer}
.chart-hint{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;margin-top:6px;opacity:.6}
/* ══ Data Explorer Summary ══ */
.data-summary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(120px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:16px}
.data-stat{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;text-align:center}
.data-stat .ds-val{font-size:26px;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.data-stat .ds-label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px;margin-top:2px}
/* ══ Sortable ZIP Table ══ */
.zip-tbl-wrap{margin:16px 0}
.zip-tbl{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:15px;table-layout:fixed}
/* Column alignment: text cols left, numeric cols right — applied to BOTH th and td (per W3C WAI guidelines) */
.zip-tbl .text{text-align:left}
.zip-tbl .num{text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.zip-tbl th{padding:9px 12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--b2);cursor:pointer;user-select:none;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;transition:color .15s}
.zip-tbl th:hover{color:var(--text)}
.zip-tbl th.sorted{color:var(--accent)}
.zip-tbl th .arr{font-size:9px;margin-left:3px;opacity:.5}
.zip-tbl th.sorted .arr{opacity:1}
.zip-tbl td{padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.zip-tbl td.num{font-weight:600}
.zip-tbl tbody tr{cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s}
.zip-tbl tbody tr:hover{background:var(--s2)}
/* ══ Data Sources Table ══ */
.ds-tbl{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:15px;margin-top:6px}
.ds-tbl th{text-align:left;padding:7px 10px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.ds-tbl td{padding:7px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.03)}
.ds-tbl td.num{text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.ai-tag{display:inline-block;font-size:9px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;margin-left:6px;vertical-align:middle;opacity:.7;letter-spacing:.3px}
/* ══ Crisis Events ══ */
.events{margin-bottom:16px}
.event{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s}
.event:hover{border-color:var(--b2);background:var(--s2)}
.event .dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0}
.event .dot.closure{background:var(--bad)} .event .dot.supply{background:var(--warn)} .event .dot.call{background:var(--accent)} .event .dot.sysalert{background:#f59e0b}
.event .ev-body{flex:1} .event .ev-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:700} .event .ev-meta{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
/* ══ Foster Youth Timeline ══ */
.youth-timeline{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:0;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:24px 8px;grid-column:1/-1}
.youth-step{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:18px 24px;text-align:center;min-width:120px;flex:0 1 160px}
.yt-age{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-bottom:4px}
.yt-stat{font-size:42px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.yt-label{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px}
.yt-arrow{font-size:22px;color:var(--muted);padding:0 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px}
.yt-delta{font-size:11px;color:var(--warn);font-weight:600}
.yt-narrative{grid-column:1/-1;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;margin-top:12px;line-height:1.5;max-width:600px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}
@media(max-width:600px){.youth-timeline{flex-direction:column;gap:6px} .yt-arrow{transform:rotate(90deg);padding:4px 0}}
/* ══ Finder ══ */
.finder{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .85fr;gap:12px;min-height:50vh}
@media(max-width:900px){.finder{grid-template-columns:1fr} .detail{visibility:hidden;position:absolute;opacity:0} .detail.active{visibility:visible;position:relative;opacity:1}}
.controls{padding:14px}
.search-row{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px}
.sinput{flex:1;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;color:var(--text);font-size:15px;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s}
.sinput:focus{border-color:rgba(139,92,246,.5)} .sinput::placeholder{color:var(--muted)}
.btn{background:var(--s2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:8px 16px;color:var(--text);font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;transition:all .15s}
.btn:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-color:var(--b2)}
.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}
.btn.pri{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:transparent}
.fsec{margin-bottom:10px}
.flbl{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-bottom:6px}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px}
.chip{font-size:12px;padding:5px 11px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--muted);transition:all .15s;user-select:none;min-height:28px}
.chip:hover{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.15);color:var(--text)}
.chip.on{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent);background:rgba(139,92,246,.1)}
.chip input{display:none}
.srow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.srow label{cursor:pointer} .srow input[type="radio"]{accent-color:var(--accent)}
.sbar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.results{padding:8px;overflow-y:auto;max-height:55vh}
/* Card entrance animation (Excellence Report §5) */
@keyframes fadeSlide{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
.card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:8px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s;animation:fadeSlide .3s ease both}
.card:hover{background:var(--s2);border-color:var(--b2);transform:translateY(-1px)}
.card:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}
.card.sel{border-color:var(--accent);background:rgba(139,92,246,.06)}
.card.closed{opacity:.5;border-color:rgba(239,68,68,.3)}
.card .nm{font-weight:700;font-size:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.card .mt{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px}
.card .badges{display:flex;gap:5px;margin-top:5px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.bdg{font-size:10px;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--muted)}
.bdg.cl{border-color:var(--bad);color:var(--bad)} .bdg.cat{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent)}
.bdg.risk{border-color:var(--warn);color:var(--warn)} .bdg.chg{border-color:#06b6d4;color:#06b6d4}
.cb-block{background:rgba(6,182,212,.06);border:1px solid rgba(6,182,212,.3);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:13px}
.cb-block ul{margin:6px 0 6px 18px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5} .cb-block p{margin:6px 0;line-height:1.5}
.cb-block .cb-src{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);font-style:italic} .cb-block .cb-nomatch{color:var(--warn)} .cb-block details{margin:6px 0}
.kpi .asof{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);font-style:italic;margin-top:2px}
/* Detail panel */
.detail{padding:18px;align-self:start}
.detail h2{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:18px;font-weight:800}
.detail .dsub{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-bottom:14px}
.kv{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:6px 12px;font-size:13px}
.kv .k{color:var(--muted);text-align:right;white-space:nowrap} .kv .v{word-break:break-word}
.dclosed{background:rgba(239,68,68,.08);border:1px solid rgba(239,68,68,.3);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:12px;font-size:13px}
/* Google Maps link (Excellence Report §5) */
.directions{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;padding:8px 16px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-radius:10px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;transition:opacity .15s}
.directions:hover{opacity:.85}
.state{padding:20px;text-align:center}
.state .t{font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px} .state .b{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
/* ══ Cross-Track Links ══ */
.xtrack{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:20px 0 8px}
.xtrack-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:12px;
  font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);text-decoration:none;
  background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);transition:all .2s}
.xtrack-btn:hover{border-color:var(--b2);background:var(--s2);transform:translateY(-1px)}
.xtrack-btn .xt-icon{font-size:16px}
.foot{text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);padding:20px;margin-top:16px}
details{margin:10px 14px} details summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);padding:6px 0}
details .inn{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);padding:6px 0;line-height:1.6}
.sec-title{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700}
@media print{body{background:#fff;color:#000} .glass{box-shadow:none;border:1px solid #ddd;background:#fff} .tabs,.btn,.alert,.foot,.chatbot,.chat-toggle,.chat-tip{display:none!important}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*::before,*::after{animation-duration:.01ms!important;animation-iteration-count:1!important;transition-duration:.01ms!important}.bg-orb{display:none}}
@keyframes pulseRed{0%{box-shadow:inset 3px 0 0 var(--bad)}50%{box-shadow:inset 3px 0 0 var(--bad),0 0 12px rgba(239,68,68,.3)}100%{box-shadow:inset 3px 0 0 var(--bad)}}
.zip-card.curveball-hit{animation:pulseRed 1s ease-in-out 3}
/* ══ Chatbot ══ */
.chatbot{position:fixed;bottom:16px;right:16px;z-index:100;width:360px;max-height:480px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;
  background:rgba(15,15,25,.92);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.6);
  backdrop-filter:blur(16px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(16px);transition:all .3s ease;overflow:hidden}
.chatbot .chat-head{padding:12px 16px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);cursor:pointer}
.chatbot .chat-head h3{margin:0;font-size:14px;font-weight:700}
.chatbot .chat-body{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:12px;font-size:13px;min-height:200px}
.chatbot .chat-msg{margin-bottom:10px;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;line-height:1.5;max-width:90%}
.chatbot .chat-msg.user{background:rgba(139,92,246,.15);margin-left:auto;border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.2)}
.chatbot .chat-msg.ai{background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid var(--border)}
.chatbot .chat-input{display:flex;gap:6px;padding:10px 12px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.chatbot .chat-input input{flex:1;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;color:var(--text);font-size:13px;outline:none}
.chatbot .chat-input button{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 14px;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer}
.chat-toggle{position:fixed;bottom:24px;right:24px;z-index:99;width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b5cf6,#ec4899);color:#fff;
  border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);font-size:22px;cursor:pointer;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(139,92,246,.5);transition:all .2s;
  animation:chatPulse 2.5s ease-in-out infinite}
.chat-toggle:hover{transform:scale(1.1);box-shadow:0 6px 28px rgba(139,92,246,.7)}
@keyframes chatPulse{0%{box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(139,92,246,.4)}50%{box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(236,72,153,.55)}100%{box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(139,92,246,.4)}}
.chat-tip{position:fixed;bottom:36px;right:90px;z-index:99;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--accent);border-radius:10px;padding:8px 14px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text);white-space:nowrap;opacity:1;transition:opacity .5s;pointer-events:none;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}
.chat-tip.hide{opacity:0}
/* QR code container — matches Oracle's working pattern */
.qr-wrap{display:block;width:140px;height:140px;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;padding:6px;margin:12px auto 0}
.qr-wrap svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}
@media(max-width:600px){.chatbot{width:calc(100vw - 32px);right:16px}}
/* ══ BUILD B2: the Get Help tab ══ */
.gh-card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:16px;margin-bottom:16px}
.gh-muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin:4px 0 10px}
.gh-presets{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:8px 0 12px}
.gh-preset{background:var(--s2);color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--b2);border-radius:12px;padding:8px 12px;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;font:inherit;min-height:44px;max-width:100%}
.gh-preset small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}
.gh-preset[aria-pressed="true"]{border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--accent) inset}
.gh-person{font-size:13px;margin:0 0 12px;padding:10px 12px;border:1px dashed var(--b2);border-radius:10px}
.gh-person ul{margin:6px 0 0 18px;padding:0}
.gh-step{border:0;margin:0;padding:0;min-width:0}
.gh-step legend{font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px}
.gh-step label{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;padding:8px 10px;margin:4px 0;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer;min-height:44px}
.gh-step input[type=number]{background:var(--s2);color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--b2);border-radius:10px;padding:10px;font:inherit;width:9rem}
.gh-err{display:block;color:var(--warn);font-size:13px;margin-top:6px}
.gh-progress{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px}
.gh-nav{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.gh-nav button,.gh-btn{background:var(--s2);color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--b2);border-radius:10px;padding:8px 14px;font:inherit;cursor:pointer;min-height:44px}
.gh-nav button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default}
.gh-nav .pri{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:#fff}
.gh-part{border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:10px;margin-top:10px}
.gh-part h4{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:15px}
.gh-opt{padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;margin:6px 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.gh-score{float:right;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);margin-left:8px}
.gh-opt ul,.gh-homes ul{margin:6px 0 0 18px;padding:0;font-size:13px}
.gh-opt details,.gh-homes details{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}
.gh-why{font-size:13px;border-left:3px solid var(--accent);padding:6px 10px;margin:6px 0;background:var(--s2)}
.gh-conf{font-size:13px;color:var(--warn)}
.gh-docs,.gh-progs,.gh-homes{padding-left:0;list-style:none}
.gh-docs li,.gh-progs li,.gh-homes li{margin:8px 0;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.gh-docs li.gh-need{border-color:var(--accent)}
.gh-tag{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;border:1px solid var(--accent);color:var(--accent);border-radius:999px;padding:0 8px;margin-left:6px}
.gh-sub{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
.gh-live{font-size:13px;margin-top:4px}
.gh-rsteps fieldset{border:0;padding:0;margin:0 0 10px;min-width:0}
.gh-rsteps legend{font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px}
.gh-rsteps label{display:inline-flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;margin:2px 12px 2px 0;min-height:36px;cursor:pointer}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="bg-orb bg-orb-1" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="bg-orb bg-orb-2" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="wrap">
  <header class="glass hdr" role="banner">
    <div><h1>{{ program_name | e }}</h1><span class="tag">{{ tagline | e }}</span></div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
      {% if domain_label_source | default('rules') == 'oracle' %}<span class="pill a" title="Domain label from the Oracle track's analysis of the same data (Claude)"><span style="font-size:9px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:4px;margin-right:4px;vertical-align:middle">AI</span>{{ domain_label | e }}</span>{% else %}<span class="pill a" title="Domain label from keyword rules over the data">{{ domain_label | e }}</span>{% endif %}
      <span class="pill" data-prov-block="{{ PB.python | e }}">{{ resource_count | py }} resources</span>
    </div>
  </header>
  {% if curveball_alert %}<div class="alert" role="alert"><span class="ico">🚨</span><div>{{ curveball_alert | built }}</div></div>{% endif %}
  {% if C.get('panel') %}
  <style>/* BRIEF PANEL (P0.3): one row per block on a phone-width screen */@media (max-width:600px){ #brief table,#brief thead,#brief tbody,#brief tr,#brief td{display:block;width:auto!important;min-width:0!important}#brief thead{display:none}#brief tr{padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.25)}#brief td{padding:3px 0!important;border:0!important}}</style>
  <details open class="glass" id="brief" data-brief-panel data-prov-block="{{ PB.python | e }}" style="margin:0 0 14px;padding:12px 16px">
    <summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:700">How this answers the brief — {{ C.panel.track_title | e }}</summary>
    <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin:8px 0 10px">{{ C.panel.mission | e }}</p>
    <div style="overflow-x:auto">
    <table class="ds-tbl" style="width:100%">
      <thead><tr><th>The brief asks</th><th>Our answer</th><th>Where</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
      {% for r in C.panel.rows %}
        <tr data-brief-row="{{ r.id | e }}" data-brief-answer="{{ r.answer_src | e }}">
          <td data-brief-cell="q" style="vertical-align:top;font-weight:600;min-width:9rem">{{ r.text | e }}</td>
          <td data-brief-cell="a" style="vertical-align:top">{{ r.answer | model }}</td>
          <td data-brief-cell="l" style="vertical-align:top;min-width:8rem">{% for l in r.links %}<a href="#{{ l.anchor | e }}" data-brief-link="{{ l.name | e }}" style="color:var(--accent)">{{ l.label | e }}</a>{% if not loop.last %}<br>{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% if not r.links %}—{% endif %}</td>
        </tr>
      {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    </div>
  </details>
  <script>
  /* === BRIEF PANEL (P0.3): a panel link shows its tab first (switchToTab), opens a closed <details> around its target, then scrolls === */
  (function(){
    var panel=document.getElementById("brief");if(!panel)return;
    if(window.matchMedia&&window.matchMedia("(max-width:600px)").matches)panel.open=false;  /* on a phone the tool comes first; the summary line stays visible */
    panel.addEventListener("click",function(ev){
      var a=ev.target.closest?ev.target.closest("a[data-brief-link]"):null;if(!a)return;
      var t=document.getElementById((a.getAttribute("href")||"").slice(1));if(!t)return;
      ev.preventDefault();ev.stopPropagation();
      var tp=t.classList.contains("tab-panel")?t:(t.closest?t.closest(".tab-panel"):null);
      if(tp&&!tp.classList.contains("active")&&typeof switchToTab==="function")switchToTab(tp.id.replace(/^panel-/,""));
      for(var n=t;n&&n!==document.body;n=n.parentElement){if(n.tagName==="DETAILS"&&!n.open)n.open=true;}
      setTimeout(function(){t.scrollIntoView({behavior:"smooth",block:"start"});},60);
    });
  })();
  </script>
  {% endif %}
  <main class="glass" role="main">
    <nav class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Dashboard views">
      {% if help %}<div class="tab active" data-tab="help" role="tab" tabindex="0">🧭 Get Help</div>{% endif %}
      <div class="tab{% if not help %} active{% endif %}" data-tab="dashboard" role="tab" tabindex="0">📊 Dashboard</div>
      <div class="tab" data-tab="finder" role="tab" tabindex="0">🔍 Find Resources</div>
      <div class="tab" data-tab="data" role="tab" tabindex="0">📈 Data Explorer</div>
    </nav>
    {% if help %}{% set HB = help.bundle %}
    <!-- ═══ TAB 0: GET HELP (BUILD B2) — the engine's intake, plan, checklist, navigator and readiness tracker ═══ -->
    <div class="tab-panel active" id="panel-help">
      <section class="gh-card" id="sec-intake" data-sec="intake" data-sec-items="{{ HB.intake.steps | length | py }}"{{ CA.get('intake', '') | built }}>
        <h3 class="sec-title" style="margin-top:0">Get help: who needs it?</h3>
        <p class="gh-muted">Pick a person from the brief, or answer the questions for someone else. A question left blank stays unknown: the plan lists what to confirm and never guesses.</p>
        <div class="gh-presets" id="gh-presets" data-prov-block="{{ PB.org | e }}" role="group" aria-label="People">
          {% for p in HB.presets %}<button type="button" class="gh-preset" data-preset="{{ loop.index0 | py }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ p.name | e }}<small>{% if p.illustrative %}Illustrative — not from the brief{% else %}{{ p.who | e }}{% endif %}</small></button>{% endfor %}
          <button type="button" class="gh-preset" data-preset="custom" aria-pressed="false">Someone else<small>answer the questions below</small></button>
        </div>
        <div class="gh-person" id="gh-person" hidden></div>
        <form class="gh-wizard" id="gh-wizard" data-prov-block="{{ PB.design | e }}" autocomplete="off" novalidate>
          <div class="gh-progress" id="gh-progress" aria-live="polite" data-num-exempt="the wizard's place among its questions (a position)">Question 1 of {{ HB.intake.steps | length | py }}</div>
          {% for st in HB.intake.steps %}{% set si = loop.index0 %}
          <fieldset class="gh-step" data-step="{{ si | py }}"{% if not loop.first %} hidden{% endif %}>
            <legend>{{ st.label | e }}</legend>
            {% if st.kind == 'number' %}<input type="number" inputmode="numeric" step="1" id="gh-num-{{ si | py }}" aria-label="{{ st.label | e }}" min="{{ st.min | default(0) | e }}" max="{{ st.max | default(120) | e }}"><span class="gh-err" role="status"></span>
            {% elif st.kind == 'sets' %}{% for sid in st.sets %}<label><input type="checkbox" name="gh-s{{ si | py }}" value="{{ loop.index0 | py }}"> {{ help.set_labels.get(sid, sid) | e }}</label>{% endfor %}
            {% else %}{% for o in st.options %}<label><input type="{{ ('checkbox' if st.multi else 'radio') | py }}" name="gh-s{{ si | py }}" value="{{ loop.index0 | py }}"> {{ o.label | e }}</label>{% endfor %}{% endif %}
          </fieldset>
          {% endfor %}
          <div class="gh-nav"><button type="button" id="gh-back">Back</button><button type="button" id="gh-next">Next</button><button type="button" class="pri" id="gh-go">See the plan</button><button type="button" id="gh-clear">Start over</button></div>
        </form>
      </section>
      <section class="gh-card" id="sec-plan" data-prov-block="{{ PB.python | e }}" data-sec="plan" data-sec-items="{{ HB.intake.plan | length | py }}"{{ CA.get('plan', '') | built }} aria-live="polite">
        <h3 class="sec-title" style="margin-top:0">Your Plan</h3>
        <p class="gh-sub" id="gh-clock"></p>
        <div id="gh-plan"><p class="gh-muted">Choose a person above, or answer the questions, to see the plan.</p></div>
        {% if chatbot_enabled %}<button type="button" class="gh-btn" id="gh-ask" hidden>Ask the chat about this plan</button>{% endif %}
        <p class="gh-sub">Ranked in this browser by the engine's published table: the gates first, then points out of 100; each option shows its breakdown and its trace. Every name, phone, hour and number comes from a record of the API or from that table.</p>
        <details class="gh-sub" id="gh-table" data-prov-block="{{ PB.design | e }}"><summary>The published table — how each set is ranked</summary>
          {% for st_ in HB.sets %}<div style="margin:8px 0"><strong>{{ st_.label | e }}</strong> ({{ st_.table.endpoint | e }}, {{ st_.table.records | e }} records)
            <div>Gates: {% for g in st_.table.gates %}{{ g.label | e }} — {{ g.text | e }}{% if not loop.last %}; {% endif %}{% endfor %}.</div>
            <ul>{% for f in st_.table.factors %}<li>{{ f.label | e }} ({{ f.max | e }} points): {{ f.formula | e }} — {{ f.why | e }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
            <div>Ties: {{ st_.table.tie_breakers | join(', ') | e }}.</div></div>{% endfor %}
        </details>
      </section>
      {% if HB.checklist %}<section class="gh-card" id="sec-checklist" data-sec="checklist"{{ CA.get('checklist', '') | built }}>
        <h3 class="sec-title" style="margin-top:0">{{ HB.checklist.label | e }}</h3>
        <p class="gh-sub">All {{ help.docs_n_h | built }} records of {{ HB.checklist.endpoint | e }}, in unlock order: a document comes before the ones it unlocks, ties by processing days. The plan marks the ones the person needs.</p>
        <ol class="gh-docs" id="gh-docs">
          {% for d in help.docs %}<li data-id="{{ d.id | e }}"><strong><span data-num-exempt="the list's own numbering (a position)">{{ loop.index | py }}.</span> {{ d.name | e }}</strong>{% if d.category %} <span class="gh-sub">· {{ d.category | e }}</span>{% endif %}{% if d.in_cycle %} <span class="gh-tag">in an unlock cycle</span>{% endif %}
            <div class="gh-sub">{{ d.days_h | built }}{% if d.fee_s %} · fee {{ d.fee_h | built }}{% endif %}{% if d.needs_names %} · after {{ d.needs_names | join(', ') | e }}{% endif %}{% if d.opens_names %} · needed for {{ d.opens_names | join(', ') | e }}{% endif %}</div>
            {% if d.unlocks_s %}<div class="gh-sub">Unlocks: {{ d.unlocks_s | e }}</div>{% endif %}
            {% if d.blockers_l %}<div class="gh-sub">Known blockers: {{ d.blockers_h | built }}</div>{% endif %}
            {% if d.help_l %}<div class="gh-sub">Who helps: {{ d.help_h | built }}</div>{% endif %}
            {% if d.notes %}<div class="gh-sub">{{ d.notes_h | built }}</div>{% endif %}
            {% if d.closed %}<div class="gh-conf">Named here but closed now: {{ d.closed | join('; ') | e }}</div>{% endif %}
          </li>{% endfor %}
        </ol>
      </section>{% endif %}
      {% if HB.navigator %}<section class="gh-card" id="sec-navigator" data-sec="navigator"{{ CA.get('navigator', '') | built }}>
        <h3 class="sec-title" style="margin-top:0">{{ HB.navigator.label | e }}</h3>
        <p class="gh-sub">All {{ help.progs_n_h | built }} programs ({{ help.set_endpoints.get(HB.navigator.set, '') | e }} records), with their age windows. With a person chosen, the programs they are inside come first, the one whose window ends soonest at the top (the youth cliff), with the years left and the person's gate result.</p>
        <ol class="gh-progs" id="gh-progs">
          {% for p in help.programs %}<li data-id="{{ p.id | e }}"><strong>{{ p.name | e }}</strong> <span class="gh-sub">· ages {{ p.window_h | built }} · intake lag {{ p.lag_h | built }} · {{ p.free_h | built }}</span>
            {% if p.check %}<div class="gh-sub">Eligibility: {{ p.check | e }}</div>{% endif %}
            <div class="gh-live" data-live></div></li>{% endfor %}
        </ol>
      </section>{% endif %}
      {% if HB.readiness %}<section class="gh-card" id="sec-readiness" data-sec="readiness"{{ CA.get('readiness', '') | built }}>
        <h3 class="sec-title" style="margin-top:0">{{ HB.readiness.label | e }}</h3>
        <p class="gh-sub">Check the steps that are done. All {{ help.homes_n_h | built }} rental properties ({{ help.set_endpoints.get(HB.readiness.set, '') | e }} records) are ranked for these answers by the same engine; each shows its screening barriers in its own words and the steps still open.</p>
        <div class="gh-rsteps" id="gh-rsteps">
          {% for st in HB.readiness.steps %}{% set ri = loop.index0 %}<fieldset data-rstep="{{ ri | py }}"><legend>{{ st.label | e }}</legend>{% for o in st.options %}<label><input type="radio" name="gh-r{{ ri | py }}" value="{{ loop.index0 | py }}"> {{ o.label | e }}</label>{% endfor %}</fieldset>
          {% endfor %}{% if HB.readiness.documents %}<fieldset data-rdocs><legend>Documents for an application (from the checklist)</legend>{% for d in HB.readiness.documents %}<label><input type="checkbox" name="gh-rdoc" value="{{ d | e }}"> {{ help.doc_names.get(d, d) | e }}</label>{% endfor %}</fieldset>{% endif %}
          <button type="button" class="gh-btn" id="gh-rclear">Clear the checked steps</button>
        </div>
        <p class="gh-sub" id="gh-rsave">Only the steps checked here are kept, in this browser; nothing else about the person is stored, and nothing leaves this page.</p>
        <ol class="gh-homes" id="gh-homes">
          {% for hh in help.homes %}<li data-id="{{ hh.id | e }}"><strong>{{ hh.name | e }}</strong>{% for v_h in hh.facts_h %} <span class="gh-sub">· {{ v_h | built }}</span>{% endfor %}
            {% if hh.barriers %}<div class="gh-sub">Screening, in the record's words: {{ hh.barriers_h | built }}</div>{% endif %}
            <div class="gh-live" data-live></div></li>{% endfor %}
        </ol>
      </section>{% endif %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    <!-- ═══ TAB 1: DASHBOARD ═══ -->
    <div class="tab-panel{% if not help %} active{% endif %}" id="panel-dashboard" data-sec="dashboard" data-sec-items="{{ ((zip_stats | default([]) | length) + (crisis_count | default(0))) | py }}"{{ CA.get('dashboard', '') | built }}>
      {% if cb_block %}<section class="cb-block" id="cb-block" data-prov-block="{{ PB.python | e }}" data-cov-skip aria-label="What changed at the curveball">
        <h3 class="sec-title" style="margin-top:0">What changed at the curveball</h3>
        <p><strong data-verbatim="the organizers' announcement">{{ cb_block.first_h | built }}</strong></p>
        <details><summary>The announcement (full text)</summary><p data-verbatim="the organizers' announcement">{{ cb_block.announcement_h | built }}</p></details>
        {% if cb_block.rows %}<ul>{% for r in cb_block.rows %}<li><strong>{{ r.endpoint | e }}</strong>: {% if r.status == 'changed' %}{% if r.added %}added {{ r.added | join(', ') | e }}{% endif %}{% if r.removed %}{% if r.added %}; {% endif %}removed {{ r.removed | join(', ') | e }}{% endif %}{% if r.changed %}{% if r.added or r.removed %}; {% endif %}changed {{ r.changed | join(', ') | e }}{% endif %}{% if not (r.added or r.removed or r.changed) %}no record changes{% endif %}{% if r.envelope %} · {{ r.envelope | e }}{% endif %}{% else %}{{ r.status | e }}{% if r.envelope %} — {{ r.envelope | e }}{% endif %}{% endif %}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
        {% elif cb_block.unchanged is none and cb_block.snapshot %}<p>No Block 1 snapshot was found, so the data could not be compared: the announcement is the only change known.</p>
        {% elif cb_block.unchanged is none %}<p>No change list of this run was found, so the data could not be compared: the announcement is the only change known.</p>
        {% else %}<p>No endpoint changed at the curveball: the data is as in Block 1.</p>{% endif %}
        {% if cb_block.alerts %}<ul>{% for a in cb_block.alerts %}<li>Alert {{ a.kind | e }}: {{ a.id | e }}{% if a.title %} — {{ a.title | e }}{% endif %} ({{ a.endpoint | e }})</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% endif %}
        {% if cb_block.closures %}<p>Closed by the announcement: {{ cb_block.closures | join(', ') | e }} — shown closed in the finder.</p>{% endif %}
        {% if cb_block.no_match %}<p class="cb-nomatch">The announcement describes a closure that matches no record in the data.</p>{% endif %}
        {% if cb_block.unchanged %}<p class="cb-src">Unchanged at the curveball (their data is Block 1's): {{ cb_block.unchanged | join(', ') | e }}.</p>{% endif %}
        {% if cb_block.unchanged is not none %}<p class="cb-src">Computed by Python from the API data: every endpoint compared record by record with Block 1's snapshot.</p>{% endif %}
      </section>{% endif %}
      <div class="hero-crisis" id="hero-crisis"></div>
      <div id="sev-bar" style="margin-bottom:14px"></div>
      <div class="kpis" id="kpi-bar"></div>
      <div class="dash-chart-box" id="dash-chart-wrap" style="display:none">
        <h3 id="dash-chart-title">Risk by Area</h3>
        <canvas id="ch-dash" aria-label="Risk metric horizontal bar chart"></canvas>
        <div class="chart-hint">Click a bar to explore that area's resources</div>
      </div>
      <h3 class="sec-title">Community Risk Profile<span class="ai-tag">⚡ ranked by tertile</span> — <em style="font-weight:400;color:var(--muted)">click a ZIP to explore resources</em></h3>
      <div class="zip-grid" id="zip-grid"></div>
      <h3 class="sec-title">Crisis Events &amp; Alerts<span class="ai-tag">⚡ from the data</span></h3>
      <div class="events" id="events"></div>
      <details><summary>About This Dashboard</summary><div class="inn"><p>Data from {{ data_inventory_h | built }}.</p><p style="margin-top:6px"><strong>{{ team_name | e }}</strong> · {{ competition_label | e }}</p></div></details>
      <details open id="sec-how-built" data-sec="how-built" data-prov-block="{{ PB.python | e }}"{{ CA.get('how-built', '') | built }}><summary>🤖 How This Tool Was Built — AI Process</summary>
        <div class="inn">
          <p id="sec-who-serves" data-sec="who-serves"{{ CA.get('who-serves', '') | built }}><strong data-cov-skip>Who this serves:</strong> {{ domain_hints_persona | e }}</p>
          {% if help and help.bundle.rationale %}<p>Built by a Python harness that runs fixed rules. The Get Help tab ranks in your browser with the engine's published table (its own copy of the engine's rules, the same rules as the Python engine, which the tests compare); {% if help.bundle.rationale.claude %}one Claude call at build time ({{ help.bundle.rationale.model | e }}) wrote the &ldquo;Why this order&rdquo; notes from the engine's figures; Python keeps a sentence only if its numbers are among that plan's figures and it names no option outside that plan, and an option no kept sentence names gets the engine's own line (its rank, score and points), marked as the engine's.{% else %}one Claude call at build time ({{ help.bundle.rationale.model | e }}) was asked for &ldquo;Why this order&rdquo; notes, and no sentence passed Python's check (its numbers among that plan's figures, no option outside that plan named): each note is the engine's own line (its rank, score and points), marked as the engine's.{% endif %} The engine decides the order, never the model. Claude helped write and test the harness and this template.</p>
          {% elif help %}<p>Built by a Python harness that runs fixed rules; the Get Help tab ranks in your browser with the engine's published table (its own copy of the engine's rules, the same rules as the Python engine, which the tests compare); no model ranks the options or writes the plan. Claude helped write and test the harness and this template.</p>
          {% else %}<p>Built by a Python harness that runs fixed rules — no AI model runs inside this tool. Claude helped write and test that harness and this template.</p>{% endif %}
          <p><strong><span data-num-exempt="the list's own numbering (a position)">1.</span> Data Ingestion</strong> — {{ endpoints_fetched | default(data_sources | default([]) | length) | py }} challenge API endpoint{{ ('' if (endpoints_fetched | default(data_sources | default([]) | length)) == 1 else 's') | py }} fetched at run time: records with a name or an address form one resource index, alert lists become events, endpoints this harness knows by name feed the dashboard&rsquo;s figures and events, and any other endpoint is counted; field names are matched by keyword rules.</p>
